# Deterministic text handling: repo-internal and checked-out line endings are LF everywhere,
# so any digest pinned over a committed text file is identical on every clone.
# (Lesson imported from the sibling programs' recorded machine gotcha: autocrlf=true checkouts
# silently CRLF-ing files whose digests were pinned, breaking verification on clean clones.)
* text=auto eol=lf
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
